# Pro

A simple static web page inspired by the Zomato homepage, built using HTML and CSS.

## Overview

This project contains a minimal landing page with:
- a branded red header
- a "ZOMATO" logo label
- a "Get App" link
- a clean, responsive static layout

## Project Structure

- `home.html` — main page structure
- `home.css` — styling for the page
- `app.html` — linked destination for the "Get App" navigation
- `zomato logo.png` — branding asset used in the project

## Features

- Static HTML/CSS implementation
- Lightweight and easy to run locally
- No framework or package installation required

## Running the Project

Because this is a static site, you can open `home.html` directly in a browser.

Alternatively, run a local server from the repository root:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
